# Lure of the Wildcat (Jeuno) (jeuno 90): the kinds of Ajithaam's replies. With ToAU's President Salaheem current (a
# GM, before login) his script answers 10176 whenever the lookup falls back to it (UseFallback: after an Event reply,
# the next talk tries his script first). 10088 is a Progress event: it plays again after a GM reset (available, the
# badge taken), where an Event would fall back to 10176. 10089 and 10090 are Events: the talk after each falls back to
# his 10176. 10091 is a Progress event: it plays right after an Event (10090), where an Event would fall back.
lists UpperJeuno/Ajithaam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10088 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10091
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-79.7,0,161.5 job=WAR lvl=20
mission Toau PresidentSalaheem current
login
trigger Ajithaam               # available: 10088
finish                         # the badge, begun
quest Jeuno.LureOfTheWildcat available # a GM
delkeyitem WhiteSentinelBadge  # a GM
trigger Ajithaam               # 10088 again (Progress: no fallback)
finish                         # the badge, begun
trigger Ajithaam               # Prog 0: 10089 (an Event)
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # after the Event: his script's 10176
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # 10089
finish
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 1     # a GM: bit 0
trigger Ajithaam               # after the Event: his script's 10176
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # some bits: 10090 (an Event)
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # after the Event: his script's 10176
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # 10090
finish
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 1048575 # a GM: all twenty bits
trigger Ajithaam               # 10091 right after the Event 10090 (Progress: no fallback)
finish                         # the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the White Invitation Card
